  "constraints": [
    "No delete endpoints are defined because neither the query patterns nor the minimal POV scope require deletion.",
    "No generic update endpoint for full test run documents is defined; only lifecycle/status updates are supported because qp-2 is the only update query pattern provided.",
    "No endpoint is defined to edit or delete progress events after insertion because the authoritative query patterns only support append and read operations.",
    "No separate endpoint is defined for arbitrary cross-run event analytics beyond qp-8, qp-7, and qp-6."
  ]
